<LegalDoc title="Privacy Policy" updated="Last updated: 19 August 2026" lang="en" altHref="/privacy">
  <p>
    DISPLAY NOW (operated by NEXTIO, "the company") collects the following when you sign up for the
    newsletter.
  </p>

  <h2>1. What we collect, and why</h2>
  <p>The one required field is your email address. It is used only to send the newsletter.</p>
  <p>
    Optionally, we collect your name, organisation, role, the sections you are interested in, and
    any note you leave for the newsroom. These are used only to understand who our readers are and
    to choose what to write about. Leaving them blank places no restriction on your subscription.
  </p>

  <h2>2. How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    We delete it immediately on request to unsubscribe. Otherwise we keep it for as long as the
    newsletter runs.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Third parties</h2>
  <p>We do not provide collected email addresses to any third party.</p>

  <h2>4. Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us to unsubscribe you and delete your information at any time by email
    (<a href="mailto:info@nextio.ai.kr">info@nextio.ai.kr</a>).
  </p>

  <h2>5. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    For anything concerning personal data, write to
    <a href="mailto:info@nextio.ai.kr">info@nextio.ai.kr</a>.
  </p>
</LegalDoc>
